  "domain": "tier0/api-probes/phase1-delete-node",
  "description": "API probe (R10): layerstack.delete_node of a fill layer and of a group holding a fill; the structure, the remaining uids and whether the deleted uids still resolve, after the delete and after save/reopen, with the events and the BaseColor export.",
